# Normalise line endings in the repository and keep binary deliverables untouched.
#
# Without this, git normalises on commit and every checkout rewrites the working
# copy, so unrelated files show up as modified. The `.docx` matters most: they are
# zip archives that were patched in place, and any text-mode filtering would
# corrupt them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.docx binary
*.doc binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.msg binary
*.ico binary
